    "text": "## Description\r\n\r\nThis dataset is a subset of the dataset obtained from the RPG Website, RPG is a geographical database used as a reference for the processing of aid from the common agricultural policy (CAP). The anonymized version distributed here as part of the public service for making reference data available contains graphic data for plots (basic land unit for farmers' declaration) with their main crop.\r\n\r\n\r\n- **Source Data Curator:** [Republique Francaise - Geoservices](https://geoservices.ign.fr/rpg)\r\n- **Source Data Provider:** [Republique Francaise - Geoservices](https://geoservices.ign.fr/rpg)\r\n- **Converted by:** Kerner Lab (ASU)\r\n- **License:** CC-BY-2.0\r\n- **Projection:** EPSG:4326\r\n- **Dataset Validity:** 2022\r\n\r\n\r\n--- \r\n\r\n## Attributes\r\n\r\n| Property                  | Data Type |\r\n| ------------------------- | --------- |\r\n| id                        | string    |\r\n| determination_datetime    | datetime  |\r\n| area                      | float     |\r\n| geometry                  | polygon   |\r\n| crop_id                   | int64     |\r\n| crop_name                 | string    |"
  },
